# Rebuildable caches -- parsed-document text and the pre-ranked candidates.
# These are derived deterministically from `query_seeds.yaml` by
# `python tools/label_retrieval.py build` / `claims --candidates-out`.
# They are large (hundreds of KB of extracted document text) and carry no
# judgement, so they are run products, not gate inputs.
#
# What IS tracked, and why:
#   query_seeds.yaml      the questions (no ground truth, just seeds)
#   sheet_*.yaml          the annotator answer sheets (the human-meaningful input)
#   annotations/*.jsonl   the append-only decision log -- the source of truth
#   retrieval_labels.yaml the gate's input, loader-checked
#   pending_labels.yaml   tool output nobody has confirmed, kept out of the gate
#   agreement.json        the inter-annotator report
worklist.json
claim_candidates_*.json